Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Pay-Pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- P... P-P-P... Page One!\N- P... P-P-P... Page One!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You burned down Okobore Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will suffer my retribution, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:26.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt Pay-Pay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- She's coming!\N- She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice! Let's have Big Mom\Ntake her down, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's starting...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:36.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to look like our guardian angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That lady's one of the bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:46.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She did the thing that upset you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that tramp, you're up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.31,0:01:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's take down Big Mom together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After I trounce that old crone,\Nyour end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for it, Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put some distance between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:24.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said "Stay right there"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-Mortar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've grown quite weary of this pursuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lion-dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your swift gait has been a thorn in my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any broken bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Komachiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in quite rough shape, you poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta reap what you sow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now stay down and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:31.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo is my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take her and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just hurt my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you just hurt my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You piece of shit lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you harm Otama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hitting a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is where I draw the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick her ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid Swordsmoron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think now is a good time for a nap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! Not only are you heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're also unwieldy as hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrying you is just a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Black Leg Sanji\Nwith a 330-million-berry bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check out who he's carrying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Pirate Hunter Zoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's one big payday stacked on another!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch what you call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The 330-million is carrying the 320-million!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That isn't any better!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're cramping my style, Moss Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Momo! Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You aren't getting through us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I needed some more scrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, I don't need you chumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,T-Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.81,0:06:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you, Big Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I switched us with some airborne debris!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Leg?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Traffy? Moss Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where am I?! Where's Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you her servant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:28.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you lounging on my shoulder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That spot is reserved for ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like I chose the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't! Where did\Nyou guys come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look after him, Black Leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up! At least explain the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro probably has twenty\Nto thirty broken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:08:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Splint him up, put him on his back,\Nand make sure he's conscious and breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not his situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you look after him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to stop Big Mom!\NSurely you can tend to some wounds?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I don't have time to tend to his wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:29.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how to apply a bandage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the same as trussing a ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm a ham to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wish you were that appetizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:53.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who managed to rough you up this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.27,0:08:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder. I can't believe\Nyou made it to the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:02.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I take it Luffy's holding up okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he figured something out...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes without saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I oughta just dump you somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are all right! What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! We've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gonna get up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know how tough those dinosaurs are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Big Mom is right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:50.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we run away,\Nshe'll never stop chasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, she hurt Otama,\Nand that's absolutely unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama, are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:06.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.59,0:10:08.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you capitulated to\Nyour demise at my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no, she's twirling around a baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A loser like you is no match\Nagainst Lady Ulti, cheerleader!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tornado...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice surprise attack, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:55.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest assured...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:11:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll have your turn\Nonce I'm through with this harlot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You rankled my senses\Nfrom the moment I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After you scurried away like a rat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you made that inane joke about\Nyour captain becoming King of the Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally get to smash your head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onami...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- Combine!\N- Combine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:11.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maser Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, it was Page One...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a-and now, Big Mom took out Ulti, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't she our ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:56.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you stand, Nami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:13:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was crazy, but you saved us! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tama! We can't save him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll come back for him later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who is that thundercloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We make one heck of a team, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:28.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could never pull off that attack\Nwith that airhead Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:31.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way, it's because you were\Nso in sync with me, right, Hera?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea, you silly boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.05,0:13:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just following Mama's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I asked Mama for a girlfriend\Nand she created you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, I like your feisty attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so refreshing to have a girl with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:05.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm sure the three of us\Nwill get along just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Napoleon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like the team\Nwill be even stronger without Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mama... Who is that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a great example of what not to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:24.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be my place... Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I gonna be all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mama! Sorry I'm late...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we have a new member?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A team of four sounds perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four? No, Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're no longer needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Sangoro, where are you heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shall lend whatever meager aid we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was trying to get to Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not headed there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon is heading for him,\Nso all will be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna help,\Ngo to the Performance Floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Performance Floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just make a request\Nand fall back asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward! To the Performance Floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Considering their forces, the longer\Nwe take, the more casualties we face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a thrill to land a hit on\Nsomeone stronger than you, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red Roc!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beat down guys who were supposed\Nto be stronger than me, one after another,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, I was\Nthe one being called the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what do I see from the peak?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a dull rock, and everyone\Non it can only punch up at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you'll never have to feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:55.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan will be destroyed,\Nand Wano will become New Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:11.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'll remain in eternal\Nboredom as the strongest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan won't be destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And one more thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I'm gonna become...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:54.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were gonna let Mama die earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you've always been a worthless screw-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all better off without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:09.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:15.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By consuming his soul,\Nyou'll become even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you say that, Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:32.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to eat him, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus! Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make her stop! Please, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for always messing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't want me anymore, I'll leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Quit squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll never show my face again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you're nothing but a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're stealing a piece of my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're truly sorry, then let her\Neat you and take your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:33.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please spare me, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:36.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Otama?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is going to be dangerous, so let's\Nget you somewhere safe, Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama! You're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onami! Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're bad pirates called the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:18.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.51,0:21:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:43.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- We're doomed!\N- We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:49.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.61,0:21:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for trying to kill you earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:21:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are so through!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a coward...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.38,0:22:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't defy Mama's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I betrayed your kindness\Nbecause I was scared to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.31,0:22:24.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a weakling and a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.57,0:22:28.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I was done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... they don't want me either!\NNow I have nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.25,0:22:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I don't wanna die\Nknowing everyone hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to forgive me. Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:23:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will be my first and last act of defiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.77,0:23:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.61,0:23:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.36,0:23:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.03,0:23:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one person...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:20.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna make amends with just one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.29,0:23:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and then I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.37,0:23:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is how I want to be remembered!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.79,0:23:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welp, there goes my energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.39,0:23:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! She's taking out his soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:52.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now eat him, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.49,0:24:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's such a klutz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of pity, have some black balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat them and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.84,0:24:15.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.17,0:24:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without a soul, even his\Nfavorite snack won't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat them, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.51,0:24:24.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.44,0:24:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surging with power!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.62,0:24:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She ate him...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.70,0:24:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi! Onami! Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.96,0:24:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.87,0:24:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.21,0:24:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.30,0:25:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama, why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.47,0:25:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.14,0:25:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're leaving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.73,0:25:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate people who leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.57,0:25:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.57,0:25:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what do we do to people I hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.33,0:25:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill them, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.00,0:25:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.19,0:25:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.77,0:25:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Gibson!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.55,0:26:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.30,0:26:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.48,0:26:39.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.65,0:26:43.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- Captain Kid!\N- Captain Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat it, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This old bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is my prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.69,0:27:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to defeat me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.77,0:27:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.54,0:27:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You're getting weaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.56,0:28:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.06,0:28:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.35,0:28:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.93,0:28:45.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this is your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.38,0:29:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can still smile?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:20.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.72,0:29:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.89,0:29:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you down again and again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.19,0:30:20.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.61,0:30:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At some point...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.03,0:30:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... I knew how this\Nwould end from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.37,0:30:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did well infusing yourself\Nwith haki during the battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.63,0:30:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But powerful weapons make you cocky, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.05,0:30:45.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humans don't give up hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.97,0:30:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, they can't give it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.73,0:31:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I was\Nthis fired up. I got careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.40,0:31:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should have taken your head\Nas a trophy and declared victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.99,0:31:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.16,0:31:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll all keep believing\Nyou're gonna win, won't they?
